cmu-colony-mail-order = Colony mail
cmu-colony-mail-arrived = Colony mail has arrived on the ASRS. Deliver it and send the signed receipts back down.
cmu-colony-mail-parcel-name = parcel for {$name}
cmu-colony-mail-parcel-desc = A parcel addressed to {$name}, {$job}. There's a delivery receipt for it in the mail crate.
cmu-colony-mail-receipt-name = delivery receipt ({$name})
cmu-colony-mail-receipt-content = [head=2]COLONY MAIL DELIVERY[/head]
    Addressed to: {$name}, {$job}
    Contents: {$item}

    Recipient's signature: ____________

    {"["}italic]Have the colonist it's addressed to sign this receipt, then send it down the ASRS for the delivery fee.[/italic]
cmu-colony-mail-receipt-signed-content = [head=2]COLONY MAIL DELIVERY[/head]
    Addressed to: {$name}
    Contents: {$item}

    Recipient's signature: [italic]{$name}[/italic]

    {"["}italic]Delivered and signed for. Send it down the ASRS for the delivery fee.[/italic]
cmu-colony-mail-sign-verb = Sign receipt
cmu-colony-mail-sign-wrong = This receipt is for {$name} to sign.
cmu-colony-mail-signed = You sign for your mail.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-name = letter
cmu-colony-mail-letter-1 = Dear {$name},
    Your mother says hello and asks when you're coming home. The harvest was poor again this year, but we're managing. Write back when you can.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-2 = {$name},
    Your back pay finally came through from the company. Don't spend it all at the bar. The paperwork is attached.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-3 = To {$name}:
    This is a reminder that your colony residency permit is due for renewal. Please present yourself to the colony administrator at your earliest convenience.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-4 = Hey {$name},
    The kids drew you a picture, it's on the back. We miss you. Stay safe out there and keep your head down.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-5 = {$name},
    Congratulations! You've been selected for this quarter's employee recognition. A certificate will follow. Keep up the good work.
cmu-colony-mail-letter-6 = Dear {$name},
    I'm sorry it's taken me so long to write. Things have been strange here. I'll explain when I see you. Burn this after reading.
